              Workouts, Tasks &amp; More)
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-lead">
              Nobody runs out of good options for dinner, exercise, or what to
              tackle first at work. What people run out of is the energy to keep
              choosing between them. This guide walks through a five-wheel
              system that removes the choosing — while leaving you in full
              control of what's actually on the wheel.
            </p>

