            <!-- Section 3 -->
            <div id="workouts">
              <div class="section-stamp">💪 Part 2</div>
              <h2>Workout &amp; Fitness Planning with a Spin Wheel</h2>

              <p>
                What derails most fitness routines isn't a lack of motivation —
                it's standing in workout gear with no clear plan and no energy
                left to make one. A fitness wheel solves both problems at once:
                it keeps sessions varied, and it removes the decision entirely.
              </p>

              <div class="quote-block">
                <p>
                  A community member who tried this for four months described
                  putting eight workout types on a wheel and simply spinning
                  each morning — noting that the missing piece was never
                  motivation, but the daily choice itself.
                </p>
                <cite>— Community feedback, 2026</cite>
              </div>

              <h3>A Three-Wheel Fitness System</h3>
              <p>
                Rather than one large fitness wheel, three smaller, linked
                wheels give you real variety without the randomness becoming an
                excuse to always pick the easiest option.
              </p>

              <div class="wheel-card">
                <div class="wheel-card-header">
                  <div class="wc-icon">🏃</div>
                  <h3>Wheel 1: Workout Type</h3>
                  <span class="wc-badge">Spin once per session</span>
                </div>
                <div class="wheel-card-body">
